WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Grandma left you a farm.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
And a secret.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.500
Grow a life.

00:08.500 --> 00:12.000
Four towns. Many stories.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
One more cast. One deep breath.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
Small friends. Big feelings.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
Follow the paths.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
Uncover what was left behind.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
A life worth coming home to.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Dewhaven.
A quiet life. A hidden adventure.
